    "c42241c1-bf09-4779-a50f-ac5974f650e1": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14811361312822__c42241c1-bf09-4779-a50f-ac5974f650e1-16654723268c573acd-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "testimonial": "<p>\"I love this masks! use them everyday and alternate the forehead & the eye mask by using the splitting cord. They are very convenient  to use and you can reuse them several times.\"<\/p><p><strong>★★★★★<\/strong><\/p>",
            "author": "Karen"
          }
        },
        "template--14811361312822__c42241c1-bf09-4779-a50f-ac5974f650e1-16654723268c573acd-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "testimonial": "<p>\"I decided to upgrade to the MyoLift QT for a few reasons. The app which guides me to how to use it on a daily basis, the mask and the device itself. I used the eye mask last night and the hands free option is wonderful. I did the facial routine and have definitely noticed a difference in my face.\"<\/p><p><strong>★★★★★<\/strong><\/p>",
            "author": "Diem"
          }
        },
        "8a1af72e-ed5c-4ffc-9ce1-474b7b2f3b2a": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "testimonial": "<p>\"I'm so glad I found the MyoLift Mini. After my first use I saw immediate results which makes me excited to continue using it to make those results last. I love the ability to see the connectivity and I love how it feels so similar to this process during a facial.\"<\/p><p><strong>★★★★★<\/strong><\/p>",
            "author": "Rachel"
          }
        }
      },
